# M2 Bite1 相对 M1 Bite2 的架构变动图：新增 gdt / idt 模块 + 运行期异常路径；main 增加初始化调用与 div 触发
direction: right

vars: {
  d2-config: {
    layout-engine: elk
    theme-id: 0
  }
}

classes: {
  new: {
    style: {
      fill: "#ede9fe"
      stroke: "#7c3aed"
      stroke-width: 3
      font-color: "#111827"
      border-radius: 10
      bold: true
      font-size: 13
    }
  }
  changed: {
    style: {
      fill: "#fef3c7"
      stroke: "#d97706"
      stroke-width: 2
      font-color: "#111827"
      border-radius: 10
      bold: true
      font-size: 13
    }
  }
  unchanged: {
    style: {
      fill: "#f3f4f6"
      stroke: "#9ca3af"
      font-color: "#6b7280"
      border-radius: 10
      font-size: 13
    }
  }
  e_new: {
    style: {
      stroke: "#10b981"
      stroke-width: 3
      font-color: "#047857"
      bold: true
      font-size: 11
    }
  }
  e_changed: {
    style: {
      stroke: "#d97706"
      stroke-width: 2
      font-color: "#92400e"
      bold: true
      font-size: 11
    }
  }
  e_unchanged: {
    style: {
      stroke: "#9ca3af"
      stroke-width: 1
      font-color: "#9ca3af"
      stroke-dash: 3
      font-size: 11
    }
  }
}

title: |md
  **M2 Bite1 相对 M1 Bite2 的架构变动**

  新增模块：gdt（扁平 GDT 接管段寄存器）、idt（256 项 interrupt gate 接管向量 0~31）｜ 新增运行期路径：asm div → #DE → stub → common → handler → printk! 双写 → hlt ｜ main 改：+gdt::init / idt::init / div 触发
| {
  near: top-center
  shape: text
}

docker: "构建容器\n未动" { class: unchanged }
iso: "kernel.iso\n未动" { class: unchanged }
seabios: "SeaBIOS\n未动" { class: unchanged }
limine: "Limine\n未动" { class: unchanged }

docker -> iso: "make build" { class: e_unchanged }
iso -> seabios: "qemu -cdrom" { class: e_unchanged }
seabios -> limine: "El Torito" { class: e_unchanged }

kernel: "kernel（信任边界）" {
  style: {
    fill: "#f9fafb"
    stroke: "#9ca3af"
    stroke-dash: 4
    border-radius: 16
    bold: true
    font-color: "#9ca3af"
  }

  start: "_start\n【改】+gdt/idt init\n+asm div 触发 #DE" { class: changed }
  limine_fb: "limine_fb\n未动" { class: unchanged }
  console: "console\n未动" { class: unchanged }
  kfont: "font\n未动" { class: unchanged }
  fb: "fb\n未动" { class: unchanged }
  serial: "serial\n未动" { class: unchanged }
  gdt: "gdt\n【新】lgdt + retfq\n重载段寄存器" { class: new }

  idt: "idt（idt.rs）【新】" {
    style: {
      fill: "#f5f3ff"
      stroke: "#7c3aed"
      stroke-width: 3
      stroke-dash: 3
      border-radius: 12
      bold: true
      font-color: "#7c3aed"
    }
    table: "IDT 256 项\n【新】向量 0~31 interrupt gate" { class: new }
    stub: "异常 stub ×32\n【新】压 err_code + vector" { class: new }
    common: "common_exception_entry\n【新】压 15 个通用寄存器" { class: new }
    handler: "exception_handler\n【新】打印现场" { class: new }
    halt: "loop { hlt }\n【新】停机" { class: new }
  }

  start -> limine_fb: "first_framebuffer()" { class: e_unchanged }
  start -> console: "init + printk!" { class: e_unchanged }
  start -> serial: "早期降级直写" { class: e_unchanged }
  console -> kfont: "glyph(ch)" { class: e_unchanged }
  console -> fb: "put_pixel" { class: e_unchanged }
  console -> serial: "镜像字节流（双写）" { class: e_unchanged }

  start -> gdt: "【新】gdt::init()" { class: e_new }
  gdt -> idt.table: "【新】KERNEL_CODE_SEL=0x08" { class: e_new }
  start -> idt.table: "【新】idt::init()：填表 + lidt" { class: e_new }
}

limine -> kernel.start: "交付 CPU" { class: e_unchanged }
limine -> kernel.limine_fb: "填写 FB response" { class: e_unchanged }

cpu: "CPU\n【新·图上】执行 div → #DE" { class: new }

kernel.start -> cpu: "【新】asm div（0/0）" { class: e_new }
cpu -> kernel.idt.stub: "【新】查 IDT 向量 0 → 跳入 stub" { class: e_new }
kernel.idt.stub -> kernel.idt.common: "【新】jmp" { class: e_new }
kernel.idt.common -> kernel.idt.handler: "【新】call（rdi=栈帧）" { class: e_new }
kernel.idt.handler -> kernel.console: "【新】printk! 双写屏幕+串口" { class: e_new }
kernel.idt.handler -> kernel.idt.halt: "【新】不返回" { class: e_new }

vram: "线性显存\n未动" { class: unchanged }
qemu_gfx: "qemu 图形\n未动" { class: unchanged }
com1: "COM1\n未动" { class: unchanged }
qemu_term: "qemu 终端\n未动" { class: unchanged }

kernel.fb -> vram: "RGB 像素" { class: e_unchanged }
vram -> qemu_gfx: "guest→窗口" { class: e_unchanged }
kernel.serial -> com1: "写 16550" { class: e_unchanged }
com1 -> qemu_term: "文本流" { class: e_unchanged }

legend: |md
  紫粗框=新增模块 · 琥珀=改动模块（main 新增调用） · 灰=未动 · 绿粗实线=新增边 · 灰虚线=未动边
| {
  near: bottom-center
  shape: text
}

footer: "Style 1 · d2/ELK · M2 Bite1 vs M1 Bite2" {
  near: bottom-right
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 11
  style.font-color: "#64748b"
}
